  94:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @brief    Extended Initialization and Configuration Functions
  95:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *
