  98:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****             ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
  99:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****  ===============================================================================
 100:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     [..]
 101:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USARTx or the UARTy
 102:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     in asynchronous mode.
 103:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode the parameters below can be configured:
 104:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Baud Rate
 105:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Word Length
 106:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Stop Bit
 107:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Parity: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
 108:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****              in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
 109:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Hardware flow control
 110:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
 111:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Over Sampling Method
 112:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) One-Bit Sampling Method
 113:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode, the following advanced features can be configured as well:
 114:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) TX and/or RX pin level inversion
 115:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) data logical level inversion
 116:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) RX and TX pins swap
 117:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) RX overrun detection disabling
 118:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) DMA disabling on RX error
 119:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) MSB first on communication line
 120:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) auto Baud rate detection
 121:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     [..]
 122:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     The HAL_RS485Ex_Init() API follows the UART RS485 mode configuration
 123:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****      procedures (details for the procedures are available in reference manual).
 124:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 125:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** @endverbatim
 126:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 127:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   Depending on the frame length defined by the M1 and M0 bits (7-bit,
 128:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   8-bit or 9-bit), the possible UART formats are listed in the
 129:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   following table.
 130:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 131:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     Table 1. UART frame format.
 132:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
 133:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |  M1 bit |  M0 bit |  PCE bit  |             UART frame                |
 134:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 135:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    0      |    | SB |    8 bit data   | STB |     |
 136:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 137:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 7 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 138:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 139:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    0      |    | SB |    9 bit data   | STB |     |
 140:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 141:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    1      |    | SB | 8 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 142:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 143:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    1    |    0    |    0      |    | SB |    7 bit data   | STB |     |
 144:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
