 152:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @brief Initialize the RS485 Driver enable feature according to the specified
 153:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *         parameters in the UART_InitTypeDef and creates the associated handle.
 154:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param huart            UART handle.
 155:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param Polarity         Select the driver enable polarity.
 156:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 157:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref UART_DE_POLARITY_HIGH DE signal is active high
 158:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref UART_DE_POLARITY_LOW  DE signal is active low
 159:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param AssertionTime    Driver Enable assertion time:
 160:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       5-bit value defining the time between the activation of the DE (Driver Enable)
 161:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       signal and the beginning of the start bit. It is expressed in sample time
 162:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       units (1/8 or 1/16 bit time, depending on the oversampling rate)
 163:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param DeassertionTime  Driver Enable deassertion time:
 164:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       5-bit value defining the time between the end of the last stop bit, in a
 165:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       transmitted message, and the de-activation of the DE (Driver Enable) signal.
 166:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       It is expressed in sample time units (1/8 or 1/16 bit time, depending on the
 167:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       oversampling rate).
